    <h2>Network Methods</h2>
    <div class="indented">
        <p>These methods return data across the entire Stack Exchange network of sites.  Accordingly, you do not pass a site parameter to them.</p>

        <h3>Access Tokens</h3>
        <div class="indented">
                    <div class="method">
            <div class="method-name">
                <a href="/docs/invalidate-access-tokens">access-tokens/{accessTokens}/invalidate</a>
            </div>
            <div class="method-description">
                Allows an application to dispose of <code>access_tokens</code> when it is done with them.
            </div>
            <br class="csp-clear" />
        </div>

                    <div class="method">
            <div class="method-name">
                <a href="/docs/read-access-tokens">access-tokens/{accessTokens}</a>
            </div>
            <div class="method-description">
                Allows an application to inspect <code>access_tokens</code> it has, useful for debugging.
            </div>
            <br class="csp-clear" />
        </div>

        </div>

        <h3>Achievements</h3>
        <div>
